{"5031310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starscrip", "steam_appid": 5031310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly. The rest of the galaxy is busy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starscrip is a single-player space RPG about trading, company management, and combat. You start with a small hull and a smaller account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody is waiting for you. The Verge was running long before you got there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand. Watch out for competition.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you grow weary of one ship, hire mercenaries. Found a company. Put their ships to work. Charter expeditions. Participate in the galactic war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But others may do the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031310/extras/cabc745a18939449c2f16788b0dec8d2.poster.avif?t=1788358416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031310/extras/cabc745a18939449c2f16788b0dec8d2.webm?t=1788358416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031310/extras/cabc745a18939449c2f16788b0dec8d2.mp4?t=1788358416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economics. And galaxy creation.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is generated over two thousand years, day by day, before your first landing. Population. Security. The cost of a ton of provisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, it keeps ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if one galaxy is not enough, you can create more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per-market mission boards for 